      <title>字节跳动推进296亿美元银团贷款 从200亿目标扩大至亚洲第二</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260903/%E5%AD%97%E8%8A%82%E8%B7%B3%E5%8A%A8%E6%8E%A8%E8%BF%9B296%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%93%B6%E5%9B%A2%E8%B4%B7%E6%AC%BE-%E4%BB%8E200%E4%BA%BF%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E6%89%A9%E5%A4%A7%E8%87%B3%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C/</link>
